 { activity: 'Earthworks cut / fill', company: 'Lounsbury', done: 100, remaining: 0, status: 'Complete', note: '<strong>COMPLETE Jul 17, 2026</strong> (Lounsbury; Apr 1 – Jul 17), confirmed again on the Aug 5 civil control sheet at 100% with no pending balance.' },
 { activity: 'Perimeter fence', company: 'Hurricane', done: 95, remaining: 5, status: 'On Track', note: 'Aug 5 civil control sheet: G-SET perimeter fence 95% (Hurricane; started Apr 2, <strong>end still TBD</strong>) — Areas A–F 100% complete, only the Zone G remainder and gates left. The last 5% is not held by production: the <strong>drain-commissioning signature from Heelstone is still outstanding</strong> and is what releases it. Chase the signature, not the crew.' },
 { activity: 'Sediment basins / environmental controls', company: 'Lounsbury / ECS', done: 95, remaining: 5, status: 'On Track', note: 'Aug 5 civil control sheet: <strong>94.8%</strong> (Lounsbury; Mar 26 – planned end Jul 24) — up from 83% on Jul 23. The remaining 5% is the Area G and Area F basin tail; the planned end date has passed. This is now the <strong>only open civil line other than the fence</strong>.' },
 { activity: 'Internal roads', company: 'Topland', done: 100, remaining: 0, status: 'Complete', note: '<strong>COMPLETE Aug 4, 2026</strong> (Topland; May 26 – Aug 4) per the Aug 5 civil control sheet. Went 35% at Week 24 to 65.9% to 72% on Jul 23 and closed out in the first week of August, four days past the Jul 31 target. <strong>Roads are no longer a logistics constraint</strong> — which matters now that Zone D piling has opened and material has to reach it.' },
 { activity: 'PS foundations', company: 'United', done: 100, remaining: 0, status: 'Complete', note: '<strong>COMPLETE Jul 24, 2026</strong> (United; Jun 8 – Jul 24) per the Aug 5 civil control sheet — all 23 inverter station foundations finished. Confirms the setting sequence: every station is founded, set and welded, and the only open inverter measure is terminations, which stand at 0 of 23. NOTE this closes the front for which the Owner raised MQ-20260804-0732 on foundation compliance — the technical answer is still owed.' },
 { activity: 'Foundation SET', company: 'AB Power', done: 24.7, remaining: 75.3, status: 'Active', note: 'Jul 31 AB Powers tracker: overall 24.7%; civil 76.8%, structural 10.8%, electrical 6.0%; <strong>piers 17 of 17 COMPLETE</strong> — Dig It poured the last one on Aug 5, closing every substation foundation. Containment berm and transformer foundation complete Jul 12. PIERS: 6 of 17 COMPLETE incl. concrete (Jul 24 — 3 added Jul 23, 1 more Jul 24), by Dig It (AB Power sub) under Axel Cano; plan holds 3-4/day. MILESTONE Jul 24: <strong>main power transformer</strong> set on its foundation. AB Power SET scope at risk — no work or delivery plan (Jul 17 review); partial scope moving to Michael Power.' }
